{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22173","headline":"自吟拙什因有所怀 · 白居易","name":"自吟拙什因有所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嬾病每多暇，暇来何所爲。\n未能抛笔研，时作一篇诗。\n诗成澹无味，多被衆人嗤。\n上怪落声韵，下嫌拙言词。\n时时自吟咏，吟罢有所思。\n苏州及彭泽，与我不同时。\n此外复谁爱，唯有元微之。\n谪向江陵府，三年作判司。\n向去二千里，诗成远不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}